## An ability that is one through another ability, not directly.
##
## This is the shape a real game reaches for almost immediately: one base with
## the choreography and the costs in it, and a concrete ability per action that
## fills in what differs. Nothing in this repository had that shape, so the scan
## that finds a project's abilities was never asked to resolve a chain longer
## than one link - and a chain is exactly where such a scan stops working.
##
## It exists to be found. Activating it is not the point and there is nothing
## here to activate.
##
